00:36:57,150 --> 00:36:59,150
RAR.

268
00:36:59,150 --> 00:37:01,271
Başka?

269
00:37:01,271 --> 00:37:02,271
Sos.

270
00:37:02,271 --> 00:37:07,271
Duyamıyorum.

271
00:37:07,271 --> 00:37:11,271
MP3.

272
00:37:11,271 --> 00:37:16,271
Başka?

273
00:37:16,271 --> 00:37:17,271
